## 🚫 FILES NEVER TO MODIFY

### Repository Internals
- `.git/` - Git internals
- `.stow-local-ignore` - Stow configuration (rarely changed)
- `.gitignore` - Git ignore rules (rarely changed)

### Generated/User Files
- `~/.dotfiles-backup/` - User backups from first install
- `.worktrees/` - Git worktrees (created by PR review skill)
- `.claude-reviews/` - PR review drafts

### Machine-Specific Files (NOT in repo)
- `~/.zshrc.local` - Machine-specific shell config
- `~/.gitconfig.local` - Git user identity
- `~/.gitconfig.work` - Work git identity
- `~/.ssh/` private keys - Security-critical
- `~/.dotfiles-installed` - Installation marker

