## 📚 QUICK REFERENCE

### Common Commands

```bash
# Navigate to dotfiles
cd ~/git/dotfiles

# Run installer (idempotent)
./scripts/install.sh

# Stow package
stow -v --target=$HOME package-name

# Restow after changes
stow -v --restow --target=$HOME package-name

# Install Brewfile packages
brew bundle --file=homebrew/Brewfile

# Test shell changes
source ~/.zshrc

# Check for broken symlinks
find ~ -maxdepth 2 -type l -xtype l

# Verify no secrets in staging
git diff --cached | grep -i "password\|token\|key\|secret"
```

### Key Locations

- **Dotfiles:** `~/git/dotfiles`
- **Install script:** `~/git/dotfiles/scripts/install.sh`
- **Brewfile:** `~/git/dotfiles/homebrew/Brewfile`
- **Shell config:** `~/git/dotfiles/zsh/`
- **Local overrides:** `~/.zshrc.local`, `~/.gitconfig.local`

### Stow Packages

aerospace, bat, borders, claude, claude-code-notifier, ghostty, git, karabiner, lazygit, nvim, sketchybar, ssh, starship, zellij, zsh

